<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Dear
&lt;name&gt;, <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">The COVID-19
pandemic has changed many things in our world, and blood collection is no
different. While we remain steadfast in our commitment to every patient who
needs lifesaving blood, the way in which we serve our mission requires more
flexibility than ever. The types of blood drives we can expect to run amidst
school and business closures or community viral outbreak impacts efficiency for
us and convenience for our valued donors, and both things really matter. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">As someone who
has answered the call to protect patient care in your community in the past, we
hope we can count on you to evolve with us as we employ new methods to achieve
a stable blood supply despite challenging times for public health. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Join us as a
<span style="color:#C00000">Blood Booster</span>, a public advocate connecting
willing and able blood donors to the most convenient location to donate near
them. <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">What is
volunteer service as a Blood Booster?<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#C00000;mso-font-width:80%"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Protect
the stability of the blood supply by creating the efficiency and flexibility of
collection needed during these challenging times<br style="mso-special-character:
line-break">
<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#C00000;mso-font-width:80%"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Support
your community’s recovery from the impacts of COVID-19, and lift spirits among
your team as you work together to fulfill the needs of the most vulnerable
among us<br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;
mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;color:#C00000;mso-font-width:80%"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Act
as liaison between the American Red Cross and businesses/organizations or your
personal connections to drive donations to specific donation events in your
area<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:1.0in;mso-add-space:
auto;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">o<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Share
the attached flyer and ask donors to download the Red Cross Blood App to
schedule their appointment<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="margin-left:1.0in;mso-add-space:
auto;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">o<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Share
info about the drives on the flyer in your social media channels or intranet<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="margin-left:1.0in;mso-add-space:auto;
text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo1"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">o<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Recruit
other Blood Boosters to extend donation invitations within their networks<br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
<!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style="mso-special-character:line-break">
<!--[endif]--><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">We are all in
this together, and no matter what role you have played in the past, or hoped to
play, we have an urgent need you can help with today—from the safety and comfort
of home! We would be so grateful for your partnership!<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">To learn more about
becoming a Blood Booster, please reference the attached information sheet. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Sincerely,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&lt;Account Representative Name&gt;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

